      <description><![CDATA[<strong>HDC2026 余总在喂星心愿墙留了言</strong><p>余总在我们的心愿墙上录了一段话🎙️ 等以后我们的卫星真上天了,这段话会被刻在芯片上,一起送进太空。 &quot;从万物互联,到天地智联,鸿蒙必将走向更广阔的未来。&quot; 你呢?如果有一句话能被送上太空、永久保存,你想说什么?💫 #HDC2026 #余承东 #万物互联 #鸿蒙7 #华为开发者大会2026</p><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609300654/c2146c4807e2ac3d47ecb52ceca7c847/1040g2sg321tlp5l2noe05q2g5cd6r9tq32amft8!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609300654/212f9008563597d94949cbcdc9e659ae/notes_uhdr/1040g3qg321bfedqqna005q2g5cd6r9tq0idqfeo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609300654/112ae0f9df446c442daaa80373836884/notes_uhdr/1040g3qg321bfedqqna0g5q2g5cd6r9tqubm78jg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609300654/aef8fc380e458c777e326dae67258b33/notes_uhdr/1040g3qg321bfedqqna105q2g5cd6r9tqn3efmgo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609300654/1fab442c492c8485d94f419367681a7a/notes_uhdr/1040g3qg321bfedqqna1g5q2g5cd6r9tq8nv05no!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609300654/c2146c4807e2ac3d47ecb52ceca7c847/1040g2sg321tlp5l2noe05q2g5cd6r9tq32amft8!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609300654/212f9008563597d94949cbcdc9e659ae/notes_uhdr/1040g3qg321bfedqqna005q2g5cd6r9tq0idqfeo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/68502b1a000000001b01a7ba/6a2cd6bb0000000021015f16?xsec_token=ABAEPNAq4MHpJY9rb68fPiNB7FL0c9UCxgavnEqxPJ__U=&amp;xsec_source=pc_user">原文</a></p>]]></description>
